                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: Thank you all for attending this meeting to discuss our ongoing initiatives. First, I'd like to congratulate Bill Anderson on making this branch friendlier toward the environment. And I'm pleased to say that the staff at our branch have been very enthus\"}],[\"text\",{\"value\":\"iastic and cooperative when it comes to our new initiatives. A recent company-wide survey by Carper Inc. head office shows that only 40 percent of our branch's employees travel to work by car now. This has really helped us to reduce vehicle exhaust polluti\"}],[\"text\",{\"value\":\"on. I’m going to hand out copies of the full report from head office so you can see the data.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "de3bf2da-5b8e-4f7d-b03d-5b9511f4ed8d",
              "body": {
                "oneOfData": {
